&lt;p class=&quot;text-copy-16 text-gray-900 [&amp;amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 my-6 [&amp;amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;amp;_i]:not-italic&quot;&gt;As a Majors Enterprise Sales Manager based in New York City, you will build and lead a New York-based Majors enterprise team within the AMER market. This is a top hiring priority for our sales organization and a foundational role in establishing sales leadership and sales culture in our new New York office. You&#39;ll be a hands-on leader and a talent magnet — someone who owns their own sourcing, builds a winning team from the ground up, and coaches AEs through complex, high-value enterprise deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-copy-16 text-gray-900 [&amp;amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 my-6 [&amp;amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;amp;_i]:not-italic&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re based within a pre-determined commuting distance of our New York City office, the role includes in-office anchor days on Monday, Tuesday, and Friday.&lt;/p&gt;
