&lt;li&gt;Developer tools or infrastructure sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC or similar methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumption pricing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven impact on revenue metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply AI pilled, already uses AI to level up others not just self&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
