&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company. We free people and agents to ship what’s next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For more than a decade, Vercel has shaped how the web is built. As the team behind Next.js, v0, and AI SDK, we create products that help builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now, software is entering a new era, and the next generation of products will not just be used by people. They will be built, extended, and operated by agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We are building the platform for that future, trusted by companies like&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;. Whether you’re building our products, supporting our customers, growing our community, or shaping our story, you’ll help define what comes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vercel is building out its Finance Center of Excellence in India, and the Senior Accountant will be a foundational hire on that team. Reporting to the Senior Manager of Accounting you will be a key contributor to the day-to-day accounting operations of international entities globally owning core processes, keeping accounting records accurate and audit-ready, and helping build the infrastructure that scales with the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is fully remote from your home office in India, with some overlapping hours with the broader global finance team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the day-to-day bookkeeping and general ledger maintenance for the international entities in NetSuite, ensuring all transactions are recorded accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and post monthly journal entries including accruals, prepayments, payroll, and intercompany recharges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform monthly account reconciliations across all balance sheet accounts and resolve open items in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closely work with accounts payables and accounts receivables team to ensure accurate accounting treatment. Support in the preparation of data for tax returns of international entities for both direct and indirect taxes and coordinate with the external consultants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Processing accounts payable (AP) and employee travel and expense (T&amp;amp;E) reimbursements, ensuring timely payments, policy compliance, accurate coding, and proper supporting documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with WHT&amp;nbsp; calculations, deductions, and timely deposits; prepare monthly / quarterly returns in coordination with the tax team and advisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with external consultants in preparation of Financial Statements and other compliance with various authorities for international entities.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile payroll processor output to NetSuite monthly and flag discrepancies for resolution. Create and reconcile monthly payroll journal entries for the international entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare supporting schedules and documentation for the annual statutory audit and coordinate with auditors on open items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Senior Accounting Manager on the monthly and quarterly close, meeting deadlines and flagging issues proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support process improvement initiatives — identify manual steps that can be automated and bring ideas to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare monthly flux analysis, balance sheet, and statutory-to-US GAAP reporting schedules for international entities, including timely investigation and closure of reconciling items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain key accounting schedules such as accruals, prepaids, fixed assets, leases, provisions, intercompany balances, bank reconciliations, and FX revaluation support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for AI-led automation across reconciliations, recurring journals, close checklists, reporting schedules, and audit support, and help build AI agents for high-impact accounting use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of accounting experience, with at least 4 years in a hands-on role at a multinational company or a Big 4 / mid-tier CA firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CA (Final) qualified; CPA or equivalent international qualification is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of statutory compliance in different countries, indirect and direct tax returns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with IFRS, US GAAP, IndAS, etc. local accounting standards and their application to a technology company context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with an ERP system; NetSuite experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills; comfortable building and maintaining reconciliation templates, schedules, and close trackers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented and well-organized, with a track record of meeting close deadlines and maintaining clean, auditable workpapers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player who communicates clearly and proactively, especially in a remote, async-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, process-minded, and improvement-focused professional who proactively identifies inefficiencies and leverages AI, automation, and systems to improve accuracy and efficiency; a clear and confident communicator who collaborates effectively across remote, cross-functional, and cross-cultural teams while thriving in async-first environments with strong ownership, accountability, and self-direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vercel is committed to fostering and empowering an inclusive community within our organization. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Vercel encourages everyone to apply for our available positions, even if they don&#39;t necessarily check every box on the job description.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company. We free people and agents to ship what’s next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For more than a decade, Vercel has shaped how the web is built. As the team behind Next.js, v0, and AI SDK, we create products that help builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now, software is entering a new era, and the next generation of products will not just be used by people. They will be built, extended, and operated by agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We are building the platform for that future, trusted by companies like&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;. Whether you’re building our products, supporting our customers, growing our community, or shaping our story, you’ll help define what comes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape a brand that moves as fast as the platform it represents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Brand Designer on Vercel&#39;s Core team, you&#39;ll help evolve the foundational visual language of a brand trusted by the most ambitious builders in the world. You&#39;ll create systems, experiences, and defining brand moments that are instantly recognizable, creatively ambitious, and built to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a purely static design role. You&#39;ll work across brand systems, digital experiences, product launches, social, motion, print, events, environments, and the occasional piece of swag. We&#39;re looking for someone who can design, prototype, and use AI-assisted code to bring brand ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a tinkerer, a visual strategist, and a creative explorer. You create clarity from complexity and actively use AI throughout your workflow to design, prototype, automate, experiment, and write code. You push the work until it&#39;s sharp, then ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is craft at speed. It&#39;s a high-impact, high-visibility role for someone who sweats the details, thinks in systems, and knows when to veer left for a one-off moment that makes people stop scrolling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We move quickly. The bar is high. Your work ships.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design across key brand moments — product launches, campaigns, events, internal initiatives, and moments not yet defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the foundational elements of Vercel&#39;s visual identity: typography, color, composition, iconography, imagery, motion, and product-brand expression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design across mediums, including web, motion, 3D, social, print, swag, and environments, choosing whatever format best serves the story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move fluidly between Figma and code — writing HTML/CSS/JS and using AI-assisted tools (v0, Cursor, Claude Code) — to prototype independently and explore new forms of brand expression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve a brand system that scales without going stale, translating it into tools, templates, and production-ready assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on from concept through final production, including preparing files, specs, and assets for implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know when motion, 3D, code, or emerging technology meaningfully strengthens an idea — and when a simpler execution serves better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a shared visual language across product, marketing, and internal comms — flexible enough to scale from everyday use to major brand moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design engineers to polish prototypes into high-quality digital experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering, marketing, product design, and leadership to align on strategy and ship cohesive work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct and collaborate with external specialists — studios, freelancers, photographers, illustrators, printers, fabricators — when execution extends beyond your own craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and defend creative decisions, connecting visual choices to brand, product, audience, and business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in brand, marketing, or visual design — ideally at a SaaS, developer tools, or fast-growing tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio showing exceptional taste, systems thinking, and execution across mediums — not just polished final images, but how you think, build systems, collaborate, navigate constraints, and get work into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional typography and layout skills, with obsessive attention to spacing, hierarchy, rhythm, proportion, and alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of visual storytelling, brand systems, composition, motion, and digital experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI throughout your process — visual exploration, prototyping, production, automation, and writing front-end code — not just to generate imagery or concepts, but to write, understand, debug, and iterate on code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with tools like v0, Cursor, Claude Code, or similar AI-assisted coding environments to build working prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — enough to refine AI-generated code to a high visual and interaction standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don&#39;t need to be a full-time engineer, but you&#39;re technically curious, comfortable in code, and capable of shipping functional prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think beyond static files and enjoy bringing ideas to life as real, interactive experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong production knowledge across digital and physical formats — responsive design, asset delivery, print prep, environmental graphics, vendor production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable moving between conceptual thinking, detailed execution, prototyping, and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how brand lives inside products and digital experiences, not just marketing campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The San Francisco, CA base pay range for this role is $156,000-$234,000. Actual salary will be based on job-related skills, experience, and location. Compensation outside of San Francisco may be adjusted based on employee location. The total compensation package may include benefits, equity-based compensation, and eligibility for a company bonus or variable pay program depending on the role. Your recruiter can share more details during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
