&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a keen and enthusiastic attorney based in San Francisco to join our small but mighty Legal team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Sales, Partnerships, Procurement, and other cross‑functional teams to negotiate commercial contracts with customers, vendors, and partners. In addition to managing a busy deal pipeline, you will use AI tools to help design and improve processes, playbooks, and programs that increase efficiency and deal velocity so the team can scale with company growth. Depending on need and interest, you may work on product development projects and other areas outside of Commercial Legal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Senior Director of Legal, Commercial and will be based in San Francisco with a 3 day/week in-office requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a primary Legal point of contact for go‑to‑market and procurement deals, providing clear, practical advice to relevant teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently manage and negotiate a variety of commercial agreements, including customer, vendor, partnership, and reseller agreements&lt;/li&gt;
